msgstr "![前のコードセルの出力](/learning/images/modules/quantum-mechanics/get-started-with-qiskit/extracted-outputs/1c4dc48d-3d2b-4b4b-b405-c93504815ba9-0.avif)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
